Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.65,0:00:09.20,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,820)\fad(520,520)\bord3\blur2}Rome
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.65,0:00:09.20,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,820)\fad(520,520)}Rome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're funny putting black ink\Nall over my spaghetti, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, sir, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is called a narrow de sapia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a classic pasta dish made with\Nfresh squid ink, hence the color.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite delicious. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, this is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hotel used to be a place\Nof class and refinement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now they let just anyone in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Signorina, accept this,\Na token of your beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:00:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not as much as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you remove this at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please think of me, and we shall\Nbe together in your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that mozzarella cheese wall\Njust say what I think he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall cast an enchantment upon\Nit, just a little love spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then you will have no choice\Nbut to fall to my passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is making me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I shall spread my chum's magic\Nto those delicious lips of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could any modern woman\Nfall for such an obvious act?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
