Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he just do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That, that was Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion, but there\Nis a phone call from a Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, Mr. Caesar Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mamma mia, I will be right\Nthere. What? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That spaghetti-brained womanizer is the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar Zeppeli we came\Nall the way here to find?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.30,0:02:36.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.30,0:02:36.76,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
