Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.39,0:02:40.60,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.39,0:02:40.60,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.98,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.98,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:02:43.98,0:02:51.23,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.98,0:02:51.23,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.98,0:02:57.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.98,0:02:57.78,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.98,0:02:57.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.78,0:03:06.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.78,0:03:06.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:02:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.50,0:03:12.59,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.50,0:03:12.59,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.38,0:03:19.22,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.38,0:03:19.22,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.22,0:03:23.06,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.22,0:03:23.06,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.06,0:03:28.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.06,0:03:28.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.57,0:03:33.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.57,0:03:33.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.57,0:03:33.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.57,0:03:33.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.82,0:03:37.66,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.82,0:03:37.66,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.66,0:03:43.45,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.66,0:03:43.45,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.45,0:03:48.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.45,0:03:48.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.01,0:03:57.30,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,0)\pos(1114,865)\blur1}{\fscx78}Episode 14: "Ultimate Warriors from Ancient Times"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.01,0:03:57.30,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,0)\pos(1114,865)\fs(70)\fscx(90)}Episode 14: "The Ultimate Warriors of an Ancient Age"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:04:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Speed Wagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.09,0:03:59.93,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.93,0:04:06.31,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}An organization founded by Speedwagon with\N the wealth he earned in the oil industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This complex was built 28 years ago with\Nfunds from the Ample Speed Wagon fortune.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.18,0:04:06.31,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(620,0)\pos(960,980)\fs(71)\fscx(95)\bord3\blur2}Speedwagon Foundation Headquarters, Washington DC
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.18,0:04:06.31,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(620,0)\pos(960,980)\fs(71)\fscx(95)}Speedwagon Foundation Headquarters, Washington DC
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here all manners of science, medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,archaeology and more are\Ngenerously funded and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exhaustively researched for\Nthe benefit of all humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,also houses a darker purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One to unlock the secret\Nof the stone masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The UV lights are very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Introduce the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was absorbed into the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son Viento isn't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body is defending itself somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he finds some\Nway to awaken in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must find a way to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster fleets on masked vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's immortal for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he's under those UV lights,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he will remain petrified and\Ncan pose no threat to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is still more research to be\Ndone if we are to understand him fully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See those?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pictures were taken in the cave\Nwhere we originally found San Viento.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inspect them carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all have different types of horns!
