Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then who are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to von Stroheim,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Germans have uncovered another\Npillar at an undisclosed location?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somewhere on the European continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their faces are stacked\Nvertically in this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking historically,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would theorize that this indicates\Nstatus or rank among the three Pillar Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo and I are headed to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim told him\Nthat we must go there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to find the\Nperson who can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it turns out that person is none\Nother than the grandson of Will A.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeppeli, Caesar Zeppeli!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, where might you be from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to take a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps one of you in the fountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, the birds in this\Ncountry sure are friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem much smarter than the\Nmen here, too, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't come all this way for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you better start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, I'm sorry, but not a chance.
