Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father then took up his torch\Nand spent his life hunting the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We Italians have the strongest familial\Nbonds of any culture in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are very proud of that tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something he'll never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:07:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you told me he didn't know about\Nhis own grandfather until just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true man knows his history.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me this true man is\Nyour host family this dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo didn't know anything because\NI kept it all a secret from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's any excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about Straizo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I was impressed to find out that\Nhe fought one of the Pillar Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I wanted to see for myself how\Ntough he was, so I waited at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm disappointed to say that his\NHamon skills leave much to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Hamon is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His defeat of the Pillar Man\Nwas nothing but blind luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be forced to\Nwork with this imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, just relax for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo is still trading...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done with the niceties here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to settle\Nthis with a good thrashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon as weak as yours couldn't pluck\Nthe petals off this delicate flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you couldn't even\Nbeat one of those pigeons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna fight me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's any mocking to be\Ndone here, I'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you kindly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave this woman a Hamon kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I just said, your weak Hamon\Ncouldn't even defeat a woman. Sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must not intervene here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be a good lesson for Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overcoming this will\Nonly make him stronger.
