Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandfather might still be alive if\Nyour grandfather hadn't gotten his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept your kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pathetic blood. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've crossed the line now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:08:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone as arrogant as you just couldn't\Nresist insulting my entire family,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could you?
