Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, my Hamon Baby Launcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important to keep oneself clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, myself, have a thin layer of\Nsoap on my clothes at all times!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking a little\Ndirty yourself, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar!
