Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I am impressed that\Nyou're still conscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your weak little Hamon\Ncouldn't even pop a bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your breath is already all over\Nthe place. Enjoy your stage. You
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,start and next you'll say now I'll\Nlift my harm on spell signorina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I'll lift my\NHum on spell, Signorina.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While that woman was throttling me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I filled a pigeon with as much hamon as\NI could and hid it away in her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd kiss her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,either because you had to withdraw\Nyour hamon or just to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out that you couldn't\Neven beat a pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a day.
