Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, just who does\Nthis jerk think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grant's standing like that\Njust to sit down in a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really can't stand people like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I had a technique\Nlike his bubble launcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.02,0:11:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be able to teach\Nhim some humility then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get stronger with my hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But training is always such a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how our little friend\Nhandles a game of chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw that Jojo deal the cards right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only cowards cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal the cards properly, Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or play elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fancy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed that you have to\Nresort to cheating and gimmicks to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are serious about cleanliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This mirror is spotless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop provoking me, Joe Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I haven't even started! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been eight hours, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind telling us\Nwhat we're waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is a German\Nsoldier doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think\Nguards the Pillowman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll get us in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behave yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again with the Germans?
