Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the Pillar Men before they awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's the beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't be embarrassed you\Nhave a girlfriend back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be going home next week so we\Ncan finally get married. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mamma mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was his wingman when he\Npicked her up, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartwarming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't get us all killed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please stop cuddling with\Nthe wheel if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you, Jojo, do\Nyou have a girlfriend back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take that as a no, but\Nyou're such a great catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't anyone want to date you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they're all too\Nbusy washing their hair, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where does this pompous ass get\Noff talking to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I develop my own killer technique,\NI'll show him a thing or two, or three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's something on his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that was there before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just rocks as long as\Nthey're under those UV lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get a closer look! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The death of Von Strauheim's team\Nis an important lesson to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we cut this pillar out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have to seal it so that it will\Nnever see the light of day again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell what that dark spot is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a hole, but\Nit might just be a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a closer look.
