Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the world has undergone\Nsignificant changes during my slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These insignificant inventions\Nmust be quite popular here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said your pitiful illuminations\Nare no match against my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.34,0:15:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands!
