Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, what sort of effects has your\NHormone had on the sleeping pillar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men hormone is only useful on the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No reason to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as my power's on stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't learn anything\Nif they're not alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you Germans don't have\Nmore than zero guards down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little quiet. Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being foolish, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:16:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right, there should be guards\Nposted all around this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:16:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.26,0:17:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't anyone tell me\Nthere were bats in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gross, I stepped in bat tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I just cleaned these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're husks of dead soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever did this could still be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know what's out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run the way, Mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
