Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ceaser! Ceaser!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have they done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just walked right through your\Nfriend like he wasn't even there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pillar Men have\Nawoken with such massive
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power that we barely even exist to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may as well be nothing more than\Na colony of ants beneath their feet!
