Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be searching for the\Nwhereabouts of the Red Stone of Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone is the last piece we\Nneed in order to complete the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, we will unleash its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, Master AC/DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the human world has changed\Nmuch over the years that we slumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago, it was the Emperor of\NRome who possessed the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I am\Ncertain that age has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, we simply need to find where\Nit is the stone currently calls home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say the Emperor cherished\Nthe stone above all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that the humans of\Ntoday still tell stories of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall retrieve the\Nstone for you, my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's time, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the moment, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us go outside and observe the changes\Nthat have occurred in the human world.
