Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize, Lord Kars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had slipped my mind that\Nyou possess a reflexive attack
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,against anyone who dares to walk\Nacross the depths of your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been 2,000 years, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have offended you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will accept whatever\Npunishment you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply cannot accept your apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your innate fighting spirit is\Nwhat makes you a great warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that is why I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fault is my own for\Ntreading upon your darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my transgression.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.54,0:20:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill me, please! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to kill me now! I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's getting so cold. Please, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't feel anything\Nat first, but now the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Caesar, you've got to kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark, there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything to\Nhelp this poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must control myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm going to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give out my love, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His whole life ahead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.04,0:21:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He worked hard for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He loved his family dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.42,0:21:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He loved his girl and his country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clean cut, the boy next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
